---
source: src/ui.rs
expression: draw(&app)
---
" gitenv  right identity, right repo                                                             "
"┌ Profiles ──────────────────────┐┌ Current repository ────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│  ● personal ┌ Help (any key to close) ─────────────────────────────────────────┐             │"
"│> ◆ acme  ada│↑ ↓  j k  move between profiles                                   │             │"
"│             │Enter     apply the selected profile to this repo                 │             │"
"│             │e         edit the selected profile                               │             │"
"│             │n         create a new profile                                    │             │"
"│             │d         delete the selected profile                             │             │"
"│             │r         re-read the repo and the profiles file                  │             │"
"│             │f         re-author unpushed commits made as someone else         │             │"
"│             │/         filter the list; Enter keeps it, Esc clears it          │             │"
"│             │D         check the selected profile's keys and logins            │             │"
"│             │s         list every repository next to this one                  │             │"
"│             │?  h      show this help                                          │             │"
"│             │q  Esc    quit                                                    │             │"
"│             │                                                                  │             │"
"│             │Applying writes user.name, user.email and, when set,              │             │"
"│             │user.signingkey, gpg.format, commit.gpgsign, core.sshCommand      │me.example:  │"
"│        _ _  │and any extra keys into .git/config.                              │             │"
"│   __ _(_) |_│                                                                  │             │"
"│  / _` | | __│● marks the profile git is using here; ◆ marks the one            │             │"
"│ | (_| | | |_│whose remote or path rules claim this repo.                       │             │"
"│  \__, |_|\__└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘             │"
"│  |___/                         ││                                                            │"
"└────────────────────────────────┘└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" ↑↓/jk select   Enter apply to repo   e edit   n new   d delete   f authors   ? help   q quit   "
